{"availability":"available","full":"Pritesh1980/sable","name":"sable","description":"Sable — a dark, editorial PWA for planning a tattoo journey: rank favourite artists, map ideas to styles, and match concepts to artists with an on-device visual Taste Engine. Local-first, React + Vite.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-19T21:04:33Z","updated":"2026-10-05T16:11:29Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["ai","clip","indexeddb","local-first","on-device-ml","pwa","react","tailwindcss","tattoo","transformers-js","vite","vitest"],"demo":"https://pritesh1980.github.io/sable/?demo=1","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.548Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.548Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.548Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.548Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sable gathers the artists you've collected — off Instagram, out of the camera roll — into a gallery built for browsing, then learns your taste by looking at their work instead of making you label it. It installs to your phone, works offline, and your reference images never leave the device.","Then as much depth as you want: a ranked shortlist, tattoo ideas linked to artists, copyable artist-ready briefs, mood boards, AI concept generation, and convention and studio context."],"features":["One place, organised by artist. Not two hundred saved posts — each artist's work, handle, styles and your own notes together on one card.","Built for looking. Four ways through the collection (filmstrip, compare, grid, style wall) plus the Wall home. Their work at full size, on black.","It learns what you like. Image embeddings computed on your device give every artist a visual fingerprint. Add someone new and Sable predicts roughly where they'd rank; open an artist and see who else in your collection…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0cb6821bc0978a071f9fd6118dce05b257fcdf22fbdf7daeca59bd8795185878","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.699Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.699Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Sable gathers the artists you've collected — off Instagram, out of the camera roll — into a gallery built for browsing, then learns your taste by looking at their work instead of making you label it. It installs to your phone, works offline, and your reference images never leave the device.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Sable gathers the artists you've collected — off Instagram, out of the camera roll — into a gallery built for browsing, then learns your taste by looking at their work instead of making you label it. It installs to your phone, works offline, and your reference images never leave the device.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"Built for looking. Four ways through the collection (filmstrip, compare, grid, style wall) plus the Wall home. Their work at full size, on black.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The sign-in screen also links straight to it (No account?","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"View the demo →), so the bare URL isn't a dead end for anyone without an account. ?demo=1 (on the default local backend) signs in a demo session and seeds six fictional artists, ranked and statused, plus a few linked tattoo ideas.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0cb6821bc0978a071f9fd6118dce05b257fcdf22fbdf7daeca59bd8795185878","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pritesh1980/sable/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.699Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated